flowchart TD
    A[New requirement<br/>or change] --> B[Write failing test<br/>Red]
    B --> C[Run test<br/>Fails as expected?]
    C -->|No| B
    C -->|Yes| D[Write minimum code<br/>to pass test]
    D --> E[Run test<br/>Green?]
    E -->|No| D
    E -->|Yes| F[Refactor<br/>clean up code]
    F --> G[Run full suite]
    G --> H{Coverage Gate<br/>scripts/gate.sh<br/>≥ 80% TS & Python?}
    H -->|Fails| I[Write more tests<br/>Do NOT soften gate]
    I --> G
    H -->|Passes| J[Commit<br/>Conventional Commit]
    J --> K{Sprint goal<br/>reached?}
    K -->|No| A
    K -->|Yes| L[Tag release<br/>e.g. v1-sprint1]
